WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 24]

01:53.090 --> 01:54.380
It was all because of me

01:55.380 --> 01:56.660
and my Sun Spirit

01:57.660 --> 01:59.460
that Luo Ge was injured so badly.

02:01.890 --> 02:03.220
Is it really wrong for me

02:04.300 --> 02:05.360
to stay by his side?

02:15.570 --> 02:16.500
Come with me.

02:20.060 --> 02:21.380
Things have changed a lot

02:21.380 --> 02:22.540
these days.

02:23.020 --> 02:24.350
You may not have noticed

02:24.579 --> 02:25.780
that sunglow has been appearing in Xiyin Mountain

02:25.780 --> 02:28.300
for several days.

02:29.180 --> 02:31.500
Sunglow is an ominous sign.

02:31.050 --> 02:35.600
♫The begonia is red, but every promise makes it more withered♫

02:32.500 --> 02:34.860
They represent danger or suffering.

02:35.660 --> 02:38.100
Since they appeared in Xiyin Mountain,

02:37.710 --> 02:42.450
♫It blooms alone, but the wind and rain are more violent♫

02:38.100 --> 02:39.630
it means that something bad

02:40.220 --> 02:41.980
will happen to Luo Ge.

02:42.970 --> 02:49.030
♫Plants are not human beings, and ruthless fruits are planted♫

02:43.820 --> 02:44.660
Ge

02:44.660 --> 02:47.060
is the only Immortal in Immortal Palace.

02:48.660 --> 02:49.740
I don't want him

02:49.740 --> 02:51.460
to be hurt again.

02:50.020 --> 02:56.010
♫How can you forget the innocence and ignorance when we first met?♫

02:52.060 --> 02:53.590
You should also understand

02:53.620 --> 02:55.980
how painful Ge is now

02:56.380 --> 02:57.620
because of your Sun Fragments.

02:57.470 --> 03:02.310
♫The butterfly emerges from the chrysalis, but it is difficult to fly to the sky♫

02:58.180 --> 03:00.940
Don't you feel sad

03:01.820 --> 03:03.880
to see someone you love suffer because of you?

03:03.880 --> 03:09.000
♫The butterfly's wings were broken, and the dream fell without a trace♫

03:09.290 --> 03:15.350
♫Because of their greed for the warmth of fire, they lost each other♫

03:15.760 --> 03:22.500
♫There is a period of youth, and he is waiting for the spring breeze in the coming year♫

03:22.740 --> 03:23.740
Please

03:24.380 --> 03:25.640
cut off his affection.

03:25.780 --> 03:28.820
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

03:27.420 --> 03:28.579
I don't want to

03:28.990 --> 03:31.770
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

03:29.980 --> 03:30.940
be in his way.

03:32.370 --> 03:34.910
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

03:34.910 --> 03:38.500
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

03:38.860 --> 03:41.450
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

03:41.450 --> 03:45.880
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

03:45.880 --> 03:52.480
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

04:11.840 --> 04:14.370
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

04:15.170 --> 04:18.279
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

04:18.500 --> 04:21.050
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

04:21.050 --> 04:25.460
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

04:25.460 --> 04:28.810
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

04:26.460 --> 04:27.700
One of you cares about all living beings,

04:27.700 --> 04:28.700
while the other one disrupts the Three Realms.

04:28.700 --> 04:29.500
You are no longer him.

04:28.830 --> 04:32.240
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

04:29.500 --> 04:30.820
If you don't believe me,

04:30.820 --> 04:32.100
you can see it yourself.

04:32.100 --> 04:33.620
I will kill you

04:32.240 --> 04:39.000
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

04:33.940 --> 04:36.940
even if I will be devastated to death by the Moon Sword.

04:50.810 --> 04:51.980
Fu,

04:52.090 --> 04:54.180
where are you going?

04:55.140 --> 04:56.580
Would you believe me

04:56.900 --> 04:59.100
if I said something happened to my race?

05:01.020 --> 05:02.020
What's your reason?

05:02.020 --> 05:03.080
There is no reason.

05:03.300 --> 05:04.960
It is the place where I grew up.

05:05.180 --> 05:06.300
My brother and I will definitely feel it

05:06.300 --> 05:07.900
if something happens there.

05:10.980 --> 05:12.180
I see.

05:13.930 --> 05:15.900
I can live for two hours without water,

05:15.900 --> 05:16.940
but my people

05:17.180 --> 05:19.180
will definitely die without water.

05:19.260 --> 05:20.820
If something really happens,

05:20.820 --> 05:22.300
they can't even escape.

05:23.860 --> 05:25.300
Will you come back

05:26.020 --> 05:27.060
after you leave?

05:31.580 --> 05:33.140
As soon as I confirm that Demon Palace is fine,

05:33.140 --> 05:34.200
I'll be right back.

05:39.740 --> 05:40.620
This way.

05:41.140 --> 05:42.260
It is

05:42.580 --> 05:44.500
the seawater from our Xiyin Mountain,

05:44.500 --> 05:46.620
which is connected to the sea of the human world.

05:46.620 --> 05:48.540
If you become invisible in the water,

05:48.540 --> 05:49.620
the people from Immortal Palace

05:49.620 --> 05:50.860
won't see you.

05:52.060 --> 05:52.900
However,

05:53.650 --> 05:54.650
you must come back

05:54.940 --> 05:55.860
before sunset.

05:58.980 --> 06:00.380
What if I don't come back?

06:02.460 --> 06:04.540
If you don't come back...

06:04.820 --> 06:06.100
It seems

06:06.420 --> 06:08.150
that I can't do anything to you.

06:09.020 --> 06:09.900
But,

06:10.060 --> 06:11.720
no matter what your choice is,

06:12.180 --> 06:13.260
I will never regret

06:13.420 --> 06:14.780
the decision I made.

06:19.740 --> 06:20.270
Luo Ning,

06:21.780 --> 06:22.380
thank you.

06:37.220 --> 06:38.100
Fu,

06:39.300 --> 06:40.740
we'll soon find out

06:41.740 --> 06:43.400
if you're trustworthy or not.

06:45.330 --> 06:47.700
I thought Liu Shao was seriously injured,

06:47.850 --> 06:48.620
so

06:48.690 --> 06:51.740
I allowed her to recuperate in Feiyuan House for a few days.

06:51.740 --> 06:52.380
Ge,

06:52.659 --> 06:55.100
your spiritual power has been severely damaged this time,

06:55.100 --> 06:57.100
and it may hurt your spiritual root.

06:57.460 --> 06:59.409
You should stop seeing her again.

07:00.180 --> 07:01.020
Sometimes...

07:01.060 --> 07:01.740
I know.

07:02.770 --> 07:04.060
I won't see her again.

07:32.460 --> 07:33.920
Haven't you found her yet?

07:34.140 --> 07:35.260
It's sunny today.

07:35.460 --> 07:36.500
Is it so difficult for you

07:36.500 --> 07:37.159
to find her?

07:37.580 --> 07:38.100
Master,

07:38.300 --> 07:39.380
we will definitely sense her aura,

07:39.380 --> 07:40.580
if she's still alive.

07:41.010 --> 07:42.300
She must have died

07:42.540 --> 07:44.470
and her body has been eaten by fish.

07:44.620 --> 07:45.659
I won't believe that

07:45.659 --> 07:46.990
she would die so easily.

08:01.700 --> 08:02.780
If she really died,

08:03.940 --> 08:06.700
there would definitely be demonic aura scattered around.

08:06.700 --> 08:08.740
There's no way we can't find any clues.

08:08.740 --> 08:09.600
I'm just afraid

08:10.340 --> 08:12.900
that someone has already taken her out of Xiyin Mountain,

08:12.900 --> 08:14.410
or used some kind of methods

08:14.410 --> 08:15.740
to hide her aura.

08:16.090 --> 08:17.740
Then... now...

08:18.100 --> 08:19.820
Hurry up and send more people to find her.

08:19.820 --> 08:20.750
Don't slack off.

08:21.460 --> 08:22.300
Yes.

08:29.860 --> 08:30.660
Brother,

08:30.820 --> 08:32.890
did you hear me?

08:33.659 --> 08:34.370
Yes.

08:35.900 --> 08:37.020
Brother.

08:37.380 --> 08:39.980
What's wrong with Liu Shao being here with you?

08:40.140 --> 08:41.380
I don't understand

08:41.380 --> 08:43.220
why they wouldn't let her see you.

08:43.220 --> 08:44.620
Brother, don't you think

08:44.650 --> 08:46.660
you've really come back to life

08:46.820 --> 08:49.020
since she came to Xiyin Mountain?

08:49.260 --> 08:50.180
So,

08:51.100 --> 08:52.460
I haven't been alive

08:53.260 --> 08:55.190
in the past thousand years, have I?

08:56.980 --> 08:57.660
No.

08:57.820 --> 08:58.340
Well...

08:58.580 --> 08:59.620
Only when there are lights in your eyes

08:59.620 --> 09:00.660
and a smile on your face,

09:00.660 --> 09:02.020
are you really alive.

09:13.740 --> 09:14.290
Brother,

09:14.500 --> 09:16.660
hasn't your Wang Bell been given to Liu Shao?

09:16.660 --> 09:18.140
Why did you take it back?

09:19.980 --> 09:21.580
I really shouldn't take back

09:22.490 --> 09:24.150
what has been given to others.

09:24.700 --> 09:25.830
Give it to her for me.

09:26.780 --> 09:27.620
No.

09:27.780 --> 09:29.380
Go by yourself.

09:30.020 --> 09:31.020
Are you going or not?

09:31.020 --> 09:31.900
No.

09:34.380 --> 09:35.060
Demon King?

09:39.460 --> 09:40.100
Immortal.

09:41.140 --> 09:42.670
I can give her this Wang Bell

09:42.860 --> 09:43.820
for you.

09:51.100 --> 09:53.900
This is the herbal tea from Xiyin Mountain Garden.

09:54.140 --> 09:56.780
Wan Sui said that it is imbued with the aura of heaven and earth,

09:56.780 --> 09:59.440
and drinking it can improve one's cultivation.

10:00.580 --> 10:02.500
You left in a hurry that day.

10:03.380 --> 10:04.060
Are you okay?

10:04.060 --> 10:05.720
I've been worrying about you.

10:07.340 --> 10:08.180
I'm fine.

10:08.290 --> 10:08.940
Really.

10:15.380 --> 10:16.910
What happened to your hand?

10:22.460 --> 10:23.060
Nothing.

10:24.300 --> 10:25.260
What's wrong?

10:26.020 --> 10:27.140
Why

10:27.620 --> 10:29.620
do you drink tea with your left hand?

10:34.300 --> 10:35.140
That's because

10:35.140 --> 10:36.540
when I was practicing

10:37.020 --> 10:38.140
the imperial flute recently,

10:38.140 --> 10:41.200
I always felt that my left hand was not flexible enough.

10:42.740 --> 10:45.140
So Mr. Tai asked me to practice my left hand.

11:15.940 --> 11:16.660
Do you

11:17.380 --> 11:19.040
have any plans for the future?

11:19.620 --> 11:20.420
Go home.

11:21.100 --> 11:21.980
I miss my home

11:22.620 --> 11:23.740
and my parents.

11:24.580 --> 11:25.310
Don't worry.

11:34.180 --> 11:36.110
This is Immortal's natal artifact

11:37.500 --> 11:39.180
that he asked me to give you.

11:40.140 --> 11:41.800
Since I have decided to leave,

11:42.580 --> 11:43.450
I can't take it.

11:44.060 --> 11:45.320
Do you still blame him?

11:46.610 --> 11:47.220
No.

11:49.100 --> 11:50.430
That's my own decision.

11:51.700 --> 11:52.740
I just hope

11:53.740 --> 11:54.580
he can be fine.

11:54.900 --> 11:56.430
You can take this Wang Bell,

11:56.980 --> 11:57.580
so that

11:58.300 --> 12:00.030
he won't feel too guilty maybe.

12:12.420 --> 12:14.380
And you can go find me at Demon Palace,

12:14.380 --> 12:16.140
if you ever feel lonely in the future.

12:16.140 --> 12:16.860
Speaking of

12:17.460 --> 12:18.460
my Demon Palace,

12:20.140 --> 12:22.200
there is still a lack of a Demon Queen.

12:22.530 --> 12:23.060
He Na...

12:24.300 --> 12:24.700
I...

12:24.700 --> 12:25.580
Just kidding.

12:26.700 --> 12:27.700
Anyway, remember

12:28.260 --> 12:29.520
that you are not alone.

12:29.620 --> 12:31.020
At least in Demon Palace,

12:32.260 --> 12:34.120
you can always take me as a friend.

12:52.340 --> 12:52.870
Brother.

12:53.780 --> 12:55.730
I felt that something happened to our people,

12:55.730 --> 12:57.390
and that made me very worried.

12:58.020 --> 13:00.020
Now it seems that nothing happened.

13:00.180 --> 13:01.540
After all, you're here.

13:01.980 --> 13:03.820
Those little demons are nothing.

13:03.820 --> 13:05.350
I knew you would be worried.

13:05.580 --> 13:06.740
That's why I would go to Immortal Palace to see you

13:06.740 --> 13:07.980
as soon as it was over,

13:08.620 --> 13:09.950
to tell you not to worry.

13:10.210 --> 13:12.060
I didn't expect you to come back.

13:13.700 --> 13:15.980
The Dan Tangerine at the door just happened to grow fruit.

13:15.980 --> 13:17.060
I knew you like it,

13:17.420 --> 13:18.620
so I brought you a few.

13:21.140 --> 13:22.470
It feels so good at home.

13:22.580 --> 13:23.540
There was Luo Ge's Protection Spell

13:23.540 --> 13:24.860
where you were trapped,

13:24.860 --> 13:25.920
how did you escape?

13:28.020 --> 13:29.480
If I really want to escape,

13:30.100 --> 13:31.540
no spell can stop me.

13:32.100 --> 13:33.700
I made an agreement with Immortal Palace

13:33.700 --> 13:34.960
that I can take you home

13:35.210 --> 13:36.780
after I recover the Four Demons.

13:36.780 --> 13:38.100
That day will come soon.

13:38.100 --> 13:39.030
Don't act rashly

13:39.140 --> 13:40.600
to cause trouble anymore.

13:42.100 --> 13:43.380
So if I say

13:43.980 --> 13:45.420
I'm not going back to Immortal Palace,

13:45.420 --> 13:47.380
will you send me back anyway?

13:48.980 --> 13:50.510
Just eat those tangerines.

13:52.980 --> 13:54.510
What happened to your hand?

13:55.380 --> 13:56.260
The spiritual veins of your hand have been destroyed,

13:56.260 --> 13:57.340
and the meridians have been broken.

13:57.340 --> 13:58.470
How could it happen?

13:59.180 --> 14:00.980
Could it be that eagle demon did it?

14:00.980 --> 14:01.710
Impossible.

14:02.260 --> 14:04.010
He should be much weaker than you.

14:04.010 --> 14:05.340
I accidentally caused it.

14:05.340 --> 14:06.180
It's okay, Fu.

14:07.420 --> 14:09.420
Even if one of my hands is destroyed,

14:12.340 --> 14:13.800
I can still bring you back.

14:17.650 --> 14:19.250
I remember you like this too.

14:20.060 --> 14:20.920
But every year,

14:21.620 --> 14:24.480
you would leave the biggest and sweetest ones to me.

14:26.620 --> 14:29.260
I'll do as you say if you want me to go bcak to Immortal Palace.

14:29.260 --> 14:30.620
I'll deal with

14:30.690 --> 14:32.490
the rest of these little demons.

14:32.740 --> 14:34.140
I'll be sure to find out

14:34.420 --> 14:36.750
who else was involved in hurting your arm.

15:07.340 --> 15:09.420
Will he come back?

15:11.390 --> 15:18.120
♫In the sea of clouds, I looked at the reflection of the moon in the water♫

15:14.820 --> 15:15.860
Kill him!

15:20.120 --> 15:24.290
♫I kept waiting and arched my palms into a circle♫

15:25.870 --> 15:32.110
♫The reflection gradually reminded me of our first meeting♫

15:32.810 --> 15:38.000
♫I can no longer tell the difference between wind and rain♫

15:39.210 --> 15:42.850
♫Even if I get the volley sword♫

15:43.360 --> 15:46.870
♫I can't forget you♫

15:46.870 --> 15:50.460
♫Our destiny has been sealed long ago♫

15:50.700 --> 15:53.470
♫I have no other choice♫

15:53.470 --> 15:57.030
♫He said that responsibility and love are difficult to balance♫

15:57.030 --> 15:59.870
♫He had no choice but to leave me♫

16:00.430 --> 16:04.090
♫The past has passed, so do not linger♫

16:04.090 --> 16:07.010
♫My love for you is still so strong♫

16:07.440 --> 16:11.210
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

16:08.940 --> 16:10.060
When you come back,

16:10.100 --> 16:11.820
I will definitely teach you a lesson.

16:11.210 --> 16:14.620
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

16:14.620 --> 16:22.670
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch, and watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

16:23.020 --> 16:26.520
♫Life is like a grain of sand♫

16:26.520 --> 16:29.960
♫It burns the fire in my heart♫

16:30.140 --> 16:38.130
♫I want to burn myself to hear you say that you have never changed♫

16:33.300 --> 16:34.100
Demon King!

16:35.660 --> 16:36.460
Don't kill me!

16:36.970 --> 16:37.780
No!

16:53.290 --> 16:57.000
♫Why have you been so far away from me every time♫

16:54.410 --> 16:55.940
Fu, you liar!

16:56.900 --> 16:58.020
Aren't you coming back?

16:57.000 --> 17:00.150
♫For billions of years♫

17:00.320 --> 17:04.109
♫Can I use your hands to warm up the world again?♫

17:04.109 --> 17:07.160
♫A few hasty nights♫

17:05.819 --> 17:07.010
If I don't come back,

17:07.619 --> 17:11.160
♫Too many intertwined oaths and lies♫

17:08.099 --> 17:10.359
are you going to smash that water energy?

17:11.160 --> 17:14.500
♫Have shattered my dreams♫

17:12.740 --> 17:13.740
No.

17:14.460 --> 17:15.700
But I can't guarantee

17:14.500 --> 17:25.020
♫Who would like to take a broken willow branch, and watch the moon alone in the blue sky♫

17:15.940 --> 17:17.400
that I won't tear you apart

17:17.500 --> 17:19.339
and feed the fish in my pond.

17:20.980 --> 17:22.819
Even if you feed countless fish,

17:23.140 --> 17:24.180
none of them

17:24.339 --> 17:25.940
will be able to help you with your homework.

17:25.940 --> 17:27.339
You seem

17:27.339 --> 17:28.780
to be right.

17:29.420 --> 17:30.140
But

17:30.260 --> 17:31.980
you're still two hours late.

17:32.780 --> 17:33.380
Tell me.

17:34.260 --> 17:36.540
How do you want me to punish you?

17:37.180 --> 17:38.380
Do whatever you want.

17:38.740 --> 17:39.820
I won't fight back.

17:41.220 --> 17:41.980
What?

17:42.340 --> 17:44.340
Were you thinking of fighting back?

17:45.780 --> 17:46.710
I wouldn't dare.

17:47.260 --> 17:47.590
Here.

17:48.740 --> 17:50.400
I brought you something good.

17:51.100 --> 17:52.630
What happened to your hand?

17:57.140 --> 17:58.490
It's fine

17:59.700 --> 18:01.740
that you sneaked out.

18:02.260 --> 18:03.820
But how could you fight

18:04.370 --> 18:05.900
with others

18:06.050 --> 18:07.500
and get hurt?

18:08.140 --> 18:09.780
You are too weak.

18:10.220 --> 18:11.420
It won't happen again.

18:11.420 --> 18:13.940
I will definitely defeat them next time,

18:14.180 --> 18:16.640
so that they don't have any chance to hurt me.

18:17.260 --> 18:18.620
What are you talking about?

18:18.620 --> 18:20.740
I'm telling you not to fight with others.

18:20.740 --> 18:23.070
I am not asking you to compete with others.

18:25.300 --> 18:25.820
Fine.

18:26.740 --> 18:27.380
I won't.

18:27.740 --> 18:28.140
Here.

18:29.370 --> 18:30.740
Have some Dan Tangerines.

18:30.740 --> 18:31.980
This Dan Tangerine tree

18:31.980 --> 18:33.020
was planted

18:33.180 --> 18:35.040
for me by my brother 900 years ago.

18:35.580 --> 18:37.220
Half of the fruit from this tree

18:37.220 --> 18:38.340
will be sent to me.

18:41.260 --> 18:42.170
So

18:42.380 --> 18:44.910
you like to eat this kind of small tangerines?

18:45.100 --> 18:47.030
Actually, it's not me who likes it.

18:48.220 --> 18:49.220
Here's the story.

18:49.220 --> 18:50.260
A long time ago,

18:50.820 --> 18:53.480
my brother once swallowed a Pearl of Fire for me.

18:53.820 --> 18:55.060
He was suffering at the time

18:55.060 --> 18:56.780
and had no appetite for anything.

18:56.780 --> 18:57.580
But one day,

18:58.260 --> 19:00.190
I saw him eat a whole Dan Tangerine,

19:01.220 --> 19:02.340
so I was very happy.

19:02.980 --> 19:04.580
Then I went out to look for it.

19:04.580 --> 19:05.980
After I found an orchard,

19:06.420 --> 19:07.170
I forced them

19:07.580 --> 19:10.040
to cut down all the fruit trees in the orchard

19:10.780 --> 19:12.460
and plant Dan Tangerines only.

19:12.460 --> 19:13.220
And then?

19:13.740 --> 19:15.420
Then my brother scolded me.

19:15.780 --> 19:18.500
From then on, he mistakenly thought that I like to eat Dan Tangerine,

19:18.500 --> 19:21.180
and even planted a Dan Tangerine tree in my house.

19:21.180 --> 19:22.140
You should know

19:22.620 --> 19:24.950
that it is not easy to grow this kind of tree

19:25.140 --> 19:26.200
in the demon world.

19:26.900 --> 19:28.260
He must have

19:28.500 --> 19:29.760
put a lot of effort into

19:30.340 --> 19:31.820
getting our Dan Tangerine tree

19:31.820 --> 19:33.020
to grow and bear fruit.

19:33.020 --> 19:34.290
You were weird too.

19:34.860 --> 19:35.700
In that case,

19:35.780 --> 19:37.580
why didn't you explain it to your brother?

19:37.580 --> 19:38.910
Of course I can't give in

19:39.060 --> 19:40.190
since he scolded me.

19:41.100 --> 19:42.430
I'm different from you.

19:42.940 --> 19:44.620
If my brother scolds me,

19:44.780 --> 19:46.100
I will give in immediately,

19:46.100 --> 19:47.500
and then act cute to him.

19:47.860 --> 19:48.620
That way

19:48.820 --> 19:50.680
he'll listen to me in everything.

19:52.220 --> 19:53.350
How is your brother?

19:53.860 --> 19:56.860
I heard something happened to Palace Chonghua today.

19:57.660 --> 19:58.780
Exactly.

19:59.260 --> 20:00.130
Even Liu Shao

20:00.330 --> 20:02.660
was imprisoned in the furnace by Bai Feng.

20:02.860 --> 20:03.460
But

20:03.490 --> 20:05.460
fortunately your brother arrived in time

20:05.460 --> 20:06.260
and saved her.

20:06.380 --> 20:07.780
So she was safe at last.

20:09.460 --> 20:10.260
My brother?

20:16.860 --> 20:17.590
It turned out

20:18.460 --> 20:21.060
that my brother was injured by the spirit fire in Immortal Palace,

20:21.060 --> 20:23.190
so he was attacked by that eagle demon.

20:23.220 --> 20:23.860
Luo Ge.

20:24.180 --> 20:24.820
Liu Shao.

20:25.780 --> 20:27.340
I will take revenge on you.

20:44.900 --> 20:45.580
You are...

20:45.860 --> 20:48.190
I am the one who once punished your people,

20:48.820 --> 20:50.940
and the one who can save your people.

20:51.260 --> 20:52.460
God of the Moonlight?

20:57.020 --> 20:58.550
I'm Fu from Aquatic Demons.

20:58.820 --> 21:00.220
Greetings, Supreme God.

21:00.380 --> 21:02.740
I know that you have a lot of resentment.

21:03.570 --> 21:04.700
So do I.

21:04.900 --> 21:07.380
If you can lift the curse of my people,

21:07.820 --> 21:09.940
I am willing to do everything

21:10.540 --> 21:13.140
to eliminate all your resentment.

21:14.060 --> 21:15.220
Good.

21:16.100 --> 21:18.980
It just so happens that I want to borrow something from you

21:18.980 --> 21:20.810
to facilitate my work tomorrow.

21:35.580 --> 21:37.980
He actually absorbed 30% of my demon power.

21:39.780 --> 21:40.940
But if he can really

21:40.940 --> 21:43.020
bring chaos to Immortal Palace,

21:45.780 --> 21:47.100
it will be worth it.

22:16.260 --> 22:18.120
If you were just that mortal Lu Li,

22:19.620 --> 22:21.930
and if only we could stay together forever

22:21.930 --> 22:23.820
after we first met that day.

22:24.540 --> 22:28.620
If I don't have the responsibility to protect all creatures in this world,

22:28.620 --> 22:31.950
and if our spiritual power won't interfere with each other,

22:32.900 --> 22:34.060
that would be great.

22:37.180 --> 22:38.580
There is a barrier of fate

22:39.340 --> 22:40.620
between us.

22:42.300 --> 22:43.500
If we can be together,

22:43.820 --> 22:47.020
I am willing to fight against the fate of the Three Realms.

22:47.260 --> 22:47.860
But...

22:49.140 --> 22:50.540
The one who would hurt you

22:51.500 --> 22:52.620
is actually me.

22:56.300 --> 22:57.340
How ridiculous.

22:58.820 --> 22:59.980
The person I hurt

23:01.060 --> 23:02.660
is the love of my life.

23:04.420 --> 23:05.980
So I can only leave you.

23:07.900 --> 23:09.060
I hated

23:10.460 --> 23:11.220
and loved

23:12.980 --> 23:14.240
this Immortal Palace.

23:16.900 --> 23:18.540
Now we will separate

23:20.140 --> 23:21.780
and forget about each other.

23:43.050 --> 23:43.860
Who are you?

23:44.730 --> 23:46.660
I am the complete you.

23:49.260 --> 23:51.060
The Four Seasons Monument is still there,

23:51.060 --> 23:52.660
all this is just my illusion.

23:54.170 --> 23:55.700
Or should I say

23:56.050 --> 23:57.780
illusions come from the heart?

24:09.660 --> 24:11.380
Why don't you give up?

24:11.900 --> 24:13.220
Why should I give up?

24:13.900 --> 24:15.170
You cut off all your emotions

24:15.170 --> 24:17.460
in order to become Immortal.

24:17.610 --> 24:19.060
You met someone you like,

24:19.060 --> 24:20.700
but you were afraid to express your love to her.

24:20.700 --> 24:22.180
Then why do you still

24:22.860 --> 24:24.650
want to be an Immortal?

24:25.340 --> 24:26.940
I have been cultivating hard

24:27.420 --> 24:28.410
for all beings

24:28.410 --> 24:29.610
and the Three Realms.

24:29.900 --> 24:31.830
My personal pursuits are nothing.

24:33.220 --> 24:34.580
Cultivating hard?

24:36.020 --> 24:37.580
If so,

24:38.580 --> 24:40.180
what do you have in your hand?

24:51.180 --> 24:53.710
What I can't escape, you can't escape either.

24:53.740 --> 24:55.780
What I can't get, you can't get either.

24:55.780 --> 24:57.180
What I have experienced,

24:57.410 --> 24:58.870
you will also experience.

24:59.820 --> 25:01.980
You will eventually become me.

25:02.020 --> 25:02.980
No way.

25:09.020 --> 25:11.940
What's the point of you cultivating hard to become an Immortal?

25:11.940 --> 25:13.660
Even if you protect all living beings,

25:13.660 --> 25:15.580
you'll lose yourself

25:15.820 --> 25:16.940
and hurt

25:18.010 --> 25:19.740
your loved ones.

25:21.300 --> 25:21.900
This is...

25:23.620 --> 25:24.290
Lu Sheng.

25:27.340 --> 25:29.070
This is Soul-devouring Spell,

25:29.100 --> 25:30.830
and I will plant it in your body.

25:30.980 --> 25:32.580
If you are in love with Liu Shao,

25:32.580 --> 25:34.500
you will trigger the spell to break out.

25:34.500 --> 25:35.900
If you can't stop your love for Liu Shao,

25:35.900 --> 25:37.660
this spell will make your blood flow backwards,

25:37.660 --> 25:39.260
bring you extreme pain.

25:39.380 --> 25:40.710
Soul-devouring Spell?

25:42.460 --> 25:43.720
This is Lu Li's memory.

25:48.260 --> 25:48.990
Impossible.

25:49.500 --> 25:50.780
I really can't break

25:51.380 --> 25:53.140
this Soul-devouring Spell.

26:13.140 --> 26:15.220
It's just Soul-devouring Spell...

26:16.300 --> 26:17.300
Why...

27:06.340 --> 27:07.140
Luo Ge.

27:19.450 --> 27:20.980
Xiyin Mountain is falling.

27:21.860 --> 27:23.520
Something happened to Luo Ge.

27:24.540 --> 27:25.940
What I have experienced,

27:26.060 --> 27:27.390
you'll experience too.

27:27.780 --> 27:30.340
You will eventually become me.

27:43.420 --> 27:44.140
Brother.

28:06.090 --> 28:06.820
Luo Ge!

28:07.620 --> 28:08.480
What happened?

28:08.610 --> 28:09.450
Are you okay?

28:10.690 --> 28:11.260
Luo Ge.

28:13.460 --> 28:14.020
Liu Shao,

28:14.660 --> 28:15.580
listen to me.

28:16.380 --> 28:18.020
This evil spirit is getting stronger and stronger.

28:18.020 --> 28:19.880
I was almost affected by it today.

28:20.540 --> 28:21.800
I have to do something.

28:22.140 --> 28:24.100
If I continue to ignore the vibration

28:24.100 --> 28:25.210
of Xiyin Mountain,

28:25.740 --> 28:28.660
I am afraid that all living beings in the Three Realms will be destroyed.

28:28.660 --> 28:29.920
How could this happen?

28:31.020 --> 28:31.380
No.

28:32.020 --> 28:33.480
It shouldn't be like this.

28:33.660 --> 28:35.390
As long as I don't bother you...

28:36.100 --> 28:37.830
This has nothing to do with you.

28:38.180 --> 28:40.240
I wanted to keep Lu Li's cultivation,

28:40.580 --> 28:43.040
but I deliberately cut off Lu Li's emotions.

28:45.780 --> 28:46.380
Now,

28:47.380 --> 28:49.510
I've been tormented by my heart demon.

28:52.180 --> 28:53.060
Luo Ge.

28:57.500 --> 28:59.100
Love will corrode the heart,

28:59.260 --> 29:01.260
and emotion will corrode the bones.

29:02.060 --> 29:04.020
It was all illusory,

29:07.060 --> 29:09.300
but I couldn't get out of this predicament.

29:09.300 --> 29:10.900
Then how can I be an Immortal?

29:11.940 --> 29:12.580
Luo Ge.

29:13.580 --> 29:14.180
Luo Ge!

29:14.540 --> 29:16.140
Then let's just give up.

29:16.140 --> 29:17.220
We can stop doing it anymore.

29:17.220 --> 29:17.900
Let's go.

29:18.700 --> 29:19.940
Let's go back, okay?

29:21.620 --> 29:23.480
It's just that if this continues,

29:23.620 --> 29:26.680
all beings in the Three Realms will be implicated by me.

29:27.980 --> 29:28.580
Liu Shao,

29:30.460 --> 29:31.700
just be yourself.

29:33.140 --> 29:34.940
I have to face my responsibility

29:35.980 --> 29:38.110
and go through the tribulation again.

29:46.500 --> 29:47.740
Luo Ge!

30:00.220 --> 30:00.860
Liu Shao.

30:01.700 --> 30:02.260
Luo Ge.

30:03.220 --> 30:03.860
Liu Shao.

30:05.620 --> 30:06.180
Luo Ge.

30:43.300 --> 30:44.580
God of the Moonlight.

30:45.900 --> 30:48.580
How did you create this Soul-devouring Spell?

30:50.020 --> 30:52.540
It forbids one to fall in love with another.

31:07.300 --> 31:08.450
Luo Ge.

31:15.140 --> 31:15.980
Luo Ge!

31:17.490 --> 31:18.780
Luo Ge!

31:24.100 --> 31:24.940
Luo Ge.

31:26.020 --> 31:28.420
You have so much responsibility to take on.

31:28.900 --> 31:31.570
This Soul-devouring Spell was given to you because of me.

31:31.570 --> 31:33.300
I should be the one to take it.

31:56.900 --> 31:57.780
Masters,

31:58.060 --> 32:00.590
have something similar happened in the past?

32:00.820 --> 32:02.020
Yes.

32:02.260 --> 32:04.700
And it also caused chaos in Immortal Palace.

32:04.700 --> 32:06.630
It will endanger the Three Realms.

32:07.460 --> 32:08.500
How can we solve it?

32:08.500 --> 32:09.140
It is said

32:09.140 --> 32:10.800
that we can get Immortal back.

32:11.050 --> 32:13.910
Or we can have another Immortal in Immortal Palace.

32:14.100 --> 32:15.760
Greetings, Immortal Master.

32:17.460 --> 32:19.220
What happened to Luo Ge this time

32:19.220 --> 32:20.460
was his misfortune.

32:20.980 --> 32:22.260
But if he can

32:22.410 --> 32:24.540
get over his heart demon and come back,

32:24.660 --> 32:26.520
he will definitely get stronger.

32:27.820 --> 32:29.330
But when will he come back?

32:29.540 --> 32:30.700
If he doesn't return,

32:30.700 --> 32:33.030
who can solve the chaos in Xiyin Mountain?

32:33.220 --> 32:35.180
If he's going to stay in the human world for another twenty years,

32:35.180 --> 32:37.540
I'm afraid the Three Realms will become chaotic again.

32:37.540 --> 32:39.300
Master Shang has been cultivating for a long time,

32:39.300 --> 32:40.820
why not let him activate Xilun Formation,

32:40.820 --> 32:42.500
so that he can become an Immortal immediately.

32:42.500 --> 32:43.860
As long we have an Immortal here,

32:43.860 --> 32:45.660
we can also solve many problems.

32:46.940 --> 32:48.670
Xilun Formation is dangerous.

32:48.780 --> 32:51.740
The person in the center of this formation will turn into stone at any moment.

32:51.740 --> 32:53.540
We cannot activate it arbitrarily.

32:53.540 --> 32:54.220
Report!

32:55.420 --> 32:56.340
Master,

32:56.420 --> 32:58.100
the cracks on the Four Seasons Monument have intensified,

32:58.100 --> 33:01.830
and there is evil aura overflowing from the bottom of the monument.

33:17.580 --> 33:19.020
Immortal Master, senior.

33:19.020 --> 33:19.770
Masters.

33:20.170 --> 33:22.140
Now is not the time to worry about other things.

33:22.140 --> 33:23.500
It is important to unite everyone's strength

33:23.500 --> 33:24.860
to seal this evil aura.

33:25.700 --> 33:26.180
Okay.

34:16.739 --> 34:18.540
Do you think I can't deal with you

34:18.780 --> 34:20.310
if you go to the human world?

34:23.460 --> 34:25.860
This little guy is really here.

34:29.260 --> 34:31.300
Since you won't let me out,

34:31.580 --> 34:34.780
I'll use the Son of the Demon King to collect divine spirit

34:35.139 --> 34:36.469
to restore my strength.

34:37.980 --> 34:41.260
I will make you pay

34:41.620 --> 34:43.750
for sealing me for ten thousand years.

34:55.120 --> 34:58.530
[Ao Hen's son, Ao Yin]

35:05.260 --> 35:05.820
Luo Ge.

35:06.540 --> 35:07.420
Where are you?

35:08.220 --> 35:10.020
Why couldn't I find you

35:10.620 --> 35:11.900
anywhere?

35:15.980 --> 35:16.500
What?

35:16.080 --> 35:18.810
[Marquis Wuyang's Mansion]

35:16.900 --> 35:17.700
Brother?

35:17.740 --> 35:18.220
Yes.

35:18.340 --> 35:19.270
Has he been here?

35:19.660 --> 35:20.220
No.

35:24.980 --> 35:25.780
I know

35:26.620 --> 35:28.540
that with the Moon Bell protecting you,

35:28.540 --> 35:29.540
you'll be safe.

35:35.940 --> 35:37.400
Luo Ge has never been here.

35:38.740 --> 35:40.260
I will send men to find him.

35:43.140 --> 35:43.820
Luo Ge.

35:44.930 --> 35:46.300
I will find you.

35:47.540 --> 35:49.470
No matter who you became this time,

35:49.900 --> 35:51.830
I would definitely recognize you.

35:52.380 --> 35:53.300
Wait for me.

35:57.970 --> 35:59.420
The God of the Moonlight

35:59.780 --> 36:00.860
is really amazing.

36:01.940 --> 36:04.020
He only used 30% of my demon power

36:04.620 --> 36:06.180
to make Luo Ge become like this.

36:06.180 --> 36:09.980
Now Immortal Palace has been busy because of Four Seasons Monument.

36:15.780 --> 36:16.380
Luo Ning.

36:17.020 --> 36:18.350
What's wrong, Luo Ning?

36:18.380 --> 36:19.310
Who bullied you?

36:19.460 --> 36:20.100
Fu.

36:20.780 --> 36:22.540
My brother has been missing for so long.

36:22.540 --> 36:24.670
Could something really happen to him?

36:25.220 --> 36:26.140
Don't worry.

36:26.700 --> 36:27.900
Luo Ge is an Immortal.

36:28.100 --> 36:29.500
He can solve any problem.

36:29.540 --> 36:31.300
But he disappeared without a trace.

36:31.300 --> 36:32.580
We also don't know his whereabouts

36:32.580 --> 36:33.660
in the human world.

36:34.100 --> 36:36.140
Immortal Palace would definitely send someone to find him.

36:36.140 --> 36:36.610
No.

36:37.340 --> 36:38.940
I'm going to find him myself.

36:39.660 --> 36:40.220
No.

36:40.410 --> 36:41.740
You've never left here.

36:41.740 --> 36:43.380
You have no idea of the dangers of the human world.

36:43.380 --> 36:44.740
If your brother knew,

36:45.020 --> 36:47.150
he would definitely not let you leave.

36:47.180 --> 36:48.700
What if something happened to your brother?

36:48.700 --> 36:49.100
I...

36:52.980 --> 36:53.540
Luo Ning.

36:55.100 --> 36:56.030
I'll go with you.

37:09.780 --> 37:10.500
Yurong.

37:10.740 --> 37:12.540
Thank you for your hard work today.

37:12.540 --> 37:13.600
It's not a big deal.

37:14.650 --> 37:16.650
It's just that we can't last too long

37:16.780 --> 37:18.710
if we take turns to fix it like this.

37:18.820 --> 37:20.350
If Luo Ge doesn't come back,

37:20.380 --> 37:21.100
the situation

37:21.100 --> 37:22.140
will get worse.

37:30.460 --> 37:31.980
If Ge doesn't come back,

37:32.090 --> 37:33.020
Immortal Palace

37:33.130 --> 37:35.180
will still keep falling,

37:35.620 --> 37:38.260
and the Four Seasons Monument will keep breaking.

37:38.260 --> 37:39.780
Then we won't be able

37:40.020 --> 37:42.540
to stop this demon from coming out.

37:42.900 --> 37:44.860
Below Xiyin Mountain is the human world,

37:44.860 --> 37:45.740
once it sinks,

37:45.900 --> 37:47.940
the entire human world will be affected.

37:47.940 --> 37:48.580
Besides,

37:48.980 --> 37:50.020
the demon under the monument

37:50.020 --> 37:52.700
once killed so many lives in the Three Realms ten thousand years ago.

37:52.700 --> 37:54.820
Now there is not even someone to stop him.

37:54.820 --> 37:55.820
Once he comes out,

37:56.060 --> 37:57.980
he will definitely kill many lives again.

37:57.980 --> 38:00.040
When Luo Ge first set this formation,

38:00.180 --> 38:02.860
he made seven talisman pearls in Liu Shao's body.

38:02.860 --> 38:04.460
Four were used up at the time,

38:04.620 --> 38:06.740
and she still has three in her body now.

38:06.740 --> 38:08.460
It should buy us some time

38:08.780 --> 38:10.440
if we use magic to get them out.

38:11.900 --> 38:13.060
But didn't Liu Shao

38:13.060 --> 38:15.020
go to the human world with Luo Ge?

38:15.480 --> 38:16.630
Before Liu Shao left,

38:16.630 --> 38:18.280
I had left a mark on her.

38:19.260 --> 38:20.860
We should be able to find her.

38:26.740 --> 38:28.800
Take my fan. This suits you very well.

38:29.580 --> 38:30.740
You're still here?

38:30.980 --> 38:31.380
Hong.

38:31.700 --> 38:32.300
Take mine.

38:32.810 --> 38:34.460
There's a fool selling pearls by the Moon River.

38:34.460 --> 38:35.420
It's interesting.

38:35.420 --> 38:36.540
Let's go. I'll take you there.

38:36.540 --> 38:37.340
Over there.

38:38.980 --> 38:40.020
Moon River?

38:40.820 --> 38:41.740
Could it be...

38:41.930 --> 38:45.470
♫I ask the cloud and the flower♫

38:45.880 --> 38:49.450
♫How I can stop missing you♫

38:52.180 --> 38:55.710
♫I walk through the time♫

38:56.070 --> 39:00.080
♫Whether we can forever♫

39:01.910 --> 39:06.680
♫Love each other like now and carve this between our eyebrows♫

39:06.680 --> 39:11.200
♫A white horse came and became a poem♫

39:12.090 --> 39:16.920
♫Memory is beautiful and I am still loving you♫

39:16.920 --> 39:21.040
♫In the vast blue sky, I prefer to pursue the moon♫

39:18.610 --> 39:19.540
Why are you here?

39:19.900 --> 39:21.040
We can catch the moon in the Moon River.

39:21.040 --> 39:23.440
♫Do you know it?♫

39:21.220 --> 39:22.350
Are you going or not?

39:23.440 --> 39:29.030
♫Thousands of lights made it like a day♫

39:24.580 --> 39:26.260
Is this the moon you mentioned?

39:26.260 --> 39:27.300
Of course not.

39:27.780 --> 39:28.710
Close your eyes.

39:29.250 --> 39:33.130
♫It is like my heart where you are still there♫

39:29.540 --> 39:30.660
Ready?

39:33.130 --> 39:39.250
♫I am waiting. The moon is above the willow branch♫

39:36.300 --> 39:37.220
How much

39:37.460 --> 39:38.460
is this bracelet?

39:38.860 --> 39:39.340
Miss.

39:39.470 --> 39:43.260
♫I only want to hold your hands and count beans of love♫

39:39.820 --> 39:41.380
This bracelet is unusual.

39:42.260 --> 39:43.260
This bead

39:43.260 --> 39:49.450
♫I am guarding you. A turning around♫

39:44.100 --> 39:46.060
was raised by the lake demons

39:46.340 --> 39:48.060
who gouged out one of their own eyes

39:48.060 --> 39:49.780
and placed it in a golden clam for their own children.

39:49.730 --> 39:53.520
♫Exchanges staying together forever♫

39:49.980 --> 39:51.140
It will definitely help you ward off demons

39:51.140 --> 39:52.270
and suppress evils.

39:53.520 --> 40:01.760
♫The love is as before♫

39:54.220 --> 39:55.020
How much is it?

39:55.140 --> 39:56.060
It's not expensive.

39:56.060 --> 39:57.180
One thousand taels.

39:57.180 --> 39:58.260
You're talking nonsense.

39:58.260 --> 39:59.020
Are you kidding?

39:59.020 --> 39:59.740
You are making up stories to lie.

39:59.740 --> 40:00.210
Yes.

40:00.580 --> 40:01.300
Mr. Lu, let's go.

40:01.300 --> 40:02.540
Mr. Shao, let's go.

40:03.820 --> 40:04.660
I'm not lying.

40:05.180 --> 40:07.240
You have no idea what you are missing.

40:11.300 --> 40:12.460
Why do I feel

40:13.850 --> 40:15.910
that someone will definitely buy it?

40:16.540 --> 40:18.800
It's not worth one thousand taels at all.

40:24.760 --> 40:27.170
♫Do you know it?♫

40:25.340 --> 40:26.540
Five thousand taels.

40:27.170 --> 40:32.750
♫Thousands of lights made it like a day♫

40:29.460 --> 40:30.190
I'll have it.

40:32.970 --> 40:36.850
♫It is like my heart where you are still there♫

40:36.850 --> 40:42.970
♫I am waiting. The moon is above the willow branch♫

40:43.190 --> 40:46.980
♫I only want to hold your hands and count beans of love♫

40:43.780 --> 40:45.180
Don't let that lake demon

